# Security audit reports.
# These enumerate security posture and findings. Keep them local — a report is
# a roadmap for anyone who reads it, even when every finding is already fixed.
# Ignored rather than merely left untracked, so `git add .` cannot sweep one in.
SECRETS-AUDIT-*.md
SECURITY-AUDIT-*.md
*-audit-report.md
